WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.304 --> 00:00:06.304
♪ Starry, starry night ♪

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:12.150
♪ Paint your palette blue and gray ♪

00:00:12.603 --> 00:00:16.693
♪ Look out on a summer's day ♪

00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:21.195
♪ With eyes that know
the darkness in my soul ♪

00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:26.195
♪ Shadows on the hills ♪

00:00:26.715 --> 00:00:31.715
♪ Sketch the trees and daffodils ♪

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:36.286
♪ Catch the breeze and winter chills ♪

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:41.286
♪ In colors on the snowy linen land ♪

00:00:43.957 --> 00:00:48.957
♪ Now I understand ♪

00:00:50.062 --> 00:00:55.062
♪ What you tried to say to me ♪

00:00:55.458 --> 00:01:00.458
♪ And how you suffered for your sanity ♪

00:01:01.122 --> 00:01:04.511
♪ And you how tried to set them free ♪

00:01:04.511 --> 00:01:09.511
♪ They would not listen,
they did not know how ♪

00:01:10.242 --> 00:01:13.640
♪ Perhaps they'll listen now ♪

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:18.640
♪ For they could not love you ♪

00:01:19.957 --> 00:01:24.957
♪ But still your love was true ♪

00:01:26.446 --> 00:01:30.150
♪ And when no hope was left in sight ♪

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:33.434
♪ On that starry, starry night ♪

00:01:33.434 --> 00:01:38.434
♪ You took your life, as lovers often do ♪

00:01:39.617 --> 00:01:43.738
♪ But I could've told you, Vincent ♪

00:01:43.738 --> 00:01:48.738
♪ This world was never meant
for one as beautiful as you ♪

00:01:53.635 --> 00:01:56.843
(gentle guitar music)

00:01:56.843 --> 00:02:01.093
(audience applauding and cheering)

